		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Floating amalgamation of metal shards, lockpicks, and other debris with a metallic skull. Undead spirit bound to a location. Created when a thief dies in a trap, this spirit resets traps and hazards.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +3 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Trap-Setter</strong>. Reset a trap within close. Does not trigger traps or hazards. Can mend or replace traps.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
